# pocket-far: the give-way's reach. A body gives way to a cell at most 4 origins from where it stands (kGiveReach),
# clear of the other body and of its next step; it is never carried back to a pocket farther off.
#  L  a 3x3 body (move east) against a 2x2 body (move west) in a lane 3 cells wide and 60 long with one pocket 4x4
#     in its north wall, 7 cells behind the small body when the two meet. They give way to each other eight times
#     each (kMaxGiveWays), a cell back and a cell on, nobody passes, and the long stand-down ends both orders (tick
#     5,374). Before the rules both stood for good; Retail walks both through (by tick 2,046).
#  X  two lanes 3 cells wide that cross, twice: a 3x3 and a 2x2 body head on in each lane, all four meeting at the
#     crossing, on attack-move orders (F) and on move orders (M). The arms of the crossing are the only places to
#     step clear to: 64 give-ways, 8 a body, nobody passes, and every order ends by tick 5,220. Before the rules
#     all eight stood for good; Retail ends all eight orders at tick 491, none arriving.
# Bounded (no body gives way more than kMaxGiveWays times on a leg, nobody is left standing with an order), but
# where a pocket lies beyond the reach, or the only room is the way the other body is going, the shuffle opens
# nothing (docs/legion-pathfinding.md, "Known weaknesses"). At start offsets 1 and -1 the meets fall differently
# (at +1 the pair of L pass each other in the pocket's mouth and arrive).
# Keys: g.LB / g.LS.complete_n and g.F* / g.M*.complete_n (1 each; all 0 before), scale.stuck_end (0),
# work.give_ways.total (80: 8 for each of the ten bodies).
scn 1
name pocket-far
ticks 6000
seed 7
players 1
weapons off
map flat 256 128
wall 34 0 60 30
wall 34 33 60 8
wall 34 44 28 20
wall 66 44 28 20
wall 62 44 4 16
wall 34 67 60 9
wall 34 79 28 20
wall 66 79 28 20
wall 62 79 4 16
wall 34 102 60 26
wall 126 0 2 128
wall 128 0 30 30
wall 161 0 31 30
wall 128 33 30 31
wall 161 33 31 31
wall 192 64 30 30
wall 225 64 31 30
wall 192 97 30 31
wall 225 97 31 31
wall 192 0 64 64
wall 128 64 64 64
type m mover 2 2500 10 1.79999
type big mover 3 2500 10 1.5
group LB 0 big 1 cells 20,99
group LS 0 m 1 cells 108,100
group FW 0 big 1 cells 132,30
group FE 0 m 1 cells 186,31
group FN 0 m 1 cells 159,4
group FS 0 big 1 cells 158,58
group MW 0 big 1 cells 196,94
group ME 0 m 1 cells 250,95
group MN 0 m 1 cells 223,68
group MS 0 big 1 cells 222,122
at 2 move LB 112 100
at 2 move LS 8 100
at 2 fight FW 188 31
at 2 fight FE 132 31
at 2 fight FN 159 60
at 2 fight FS 159 4
at 2 move MW 252 95
at 2 move ME 196 95
at 2 move MN 223 124
at 2 move MS 223 68
